COMPILATION OF: E48A13

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A13

   1 a 0000 E48A13:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] `if ^(k = 0) then' and `do while(^(n = 3))'.
   4 a 0006      The parser gives both an Econd around a relation; whether DR
   5 a 0006      has a NOT-condition lowering at all is UNMEASURED (the corpus
   6 a 0006      uses `^' only on bit cells and inside strings). */
   7 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
   8 c 0006   dcl n fixed bin(15);
   9 c 0006   k = 0;
  10 c 000C   n = 0;
  11 c 000F   if ^(k = 0) then
  12 c 0018      put list('A');
  13 c 002F   do while(^(n = 3));
  14 c 003A      n = n + 1;
  15 c 0044   end;
  16 c 0044   put list('N=', n);
  17 c 0066   stop;
  18 a 0069 end E48A13;

CODE SIZE = 0069
DATA AREA = 0007
FREE SYMS = 3881
END  COMPILATION
